{"title": "Fission-C", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">25 Fission-C</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-images\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Preview\">Preview</div><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Icon\">Icon</div><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab\" data-druid=\"1-3\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In space\">In space</div></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-files\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Preview\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FissionPreviewImage.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"FissionPreviewImage.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/FissionPreviewImage.png/250px-FissionPreviewImage.png?26d246\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"209\" srcset=\"/images/FissionPreviewImage.png?26d246 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"251\" /></a></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Icon\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fission-C_(Icon).png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Fission-C (Icon).png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Fission-C_%28Icon%29.png/250px-Fission-C_%28Icon%29.png?8bd9b8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"/images/Fission-C_%28Icon%29.png?8bd9b8 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable\" data-druid=\"1-3\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In space\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fission-C_in_space.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Fission-C in space.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Fission-C_in_space.jpg/250px-Fission-C_in_space.jpg?a39401\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fission-C_in_space.jpg/375px-Fission-C_in_space.jpg?a39401 1.5x, /images/thumb/Fission-C_in_space.jpg/500px-Fission-C_in_space.jpg?a39401 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-LevelInformation\">Level Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Price\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Price\">Price</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Price druid-data-nonempty\">\n&#9646;600</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-HazardLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-HazardLevel\">Hazard Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-HazardLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\nA</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SupportedWeather(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SupportedWeather(s)\">Supported Weather(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SupportedWeather(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nRainy, Stormy, Foggy, Flooded, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Hurricane, Minefield</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-TerrainforCruiser\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-TerrainforCruiser\">Terrain for Cruiser?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-TerrainforCruiser druid-data-nonempty\">\nNo</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Technical\">Technical</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorSizeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorSizeMultiplier\">Interior Size Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorSizeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.51</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorsSpawnChances\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorsSpawnChances\">Interiors Spawn Chances</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorsSpawnChances druid-data-nonempty\">\nFacility: 0.24%<br />Mansion: 0.001%<br />Mineshaft: 0.16%<br />Asten Lab: 19.90%<br />Atlantean Citadel: 0.01%<br />Carnival: 0.001%<br /><b>Expanded Facility: 39.79%</b><br />Fractured Complex: 19.90%<br />Greenhouse: 0.05%<br />Rubber Rooms: 0.05%<br />Toy Store: 19.90%</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MinimumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MinimumScrap\">Minimum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MinimumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n33</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaximumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaximumScrap\">Maximum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaximumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n39</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SpikeTraps\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SpikeTraps\">Spike Traps</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 7</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 12</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nCadaver Growth, Roaming Locusts, Hygrodere, Snare Flea, Nutcracker</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nJester, Circuit Bees, Hygrodere, Eyeless Dog</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n9</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n7</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n10</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Weather</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Inside_Ambience\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inside Ambience</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Inside_Ambience_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inside Ambience</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Toxic_Waste\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Toxic Waste</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Toxic_Barrles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Toxic Barrles</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Altar_(Mysterious_Object&#39;s_Slot)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Altar (Mysterious Object's Slot)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#The_Plan_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Plan 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-21\"><a href=\"#The_Plan_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Plan 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-22\"><a href=\"#The_Plan_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Plan 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-23\"><a href=\"#The_Plan_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Plan 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-24\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Sector C of Fission</b> houses an old toy factory later repurposed as nuclear power plant. However this power plant was abandoned many rotations ago due to health inspection failure. Now this structure is crumbling and all those who visit will leave changed.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fission-C_topvieww.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Fission-C topvieww.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Fission-C_topvieww.jpg/650px-Fission-C_topvieww.jpg?651854\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"650\" height=\"366\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fission-C_topvieww.jpg/975px-Fission-C_topvieww.jpg?651854 1.5x, /images/thumb/Fission-C_topvieww.jpg/1300px-Fission-C_topvieww.jpg?651854 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Gone.<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Hot dry toxic terrain, no surviving flora.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> An irradiated ecosystem.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<div class=\"ambox\" style=\"--ambox-color: #0094FF;\"><div class=\"ambox-icon metadata\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/48px-Information.png?c7ec8d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/72px-Information.png?c7ec8d 1.5x, https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/96px-Information.png?c7ec8d 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"ambox-content\"><p class=\"ambox-title\">Unfinished Section</p><p class=\"ambox-text\">This section seems unfinished. If you're a wiki editor, please help with completing this section.</p></div></div>\n<p>Fission-C is an abaondoned toxic wasteland which used to be a powerplant. There ae shipping containers and toxic waste around the moon's surface.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p>Fission-C can experience Rainy, Stormy, Foggy, Flooded, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Hurricane, or Minefield weather by default.\n</p><p>If Fission-C is Flooded, the pools of toxic waste on the exterior will have already risen and will continue to rise even higher throughout the day.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inside_Ambience\">Inside Ambience</span></h3>\n<p>On Fission-C you can hear an ambience that plays inside the facility.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inside_Ambience_2\">Inside Ambience</span></h4>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"18\" data-mwtitle=\"Fission_inside_loop.wav\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Fission_inside_loop.wav?1aca7d\" type=\"audio/wav\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Fission_inside_loop.wav/Fission_inside_loop.wav.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Fission_inside_loop.wav/Fission_inside_loop.wav.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-transcodekey=\"mp3\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Toxic_Waste\">Toxic Waste</span></h3>\n<p><b>Fission-C's exterior has toxic waste</b> that will <b>rapidly deal 12 damage per hit</b> to the player while standing in it. This toxic waste behaves similar to flooding in that it will rise in specific areas throughout the day.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Toxic_Barrles\">Toxic Barrles</span></h3>\n<p><b>Fission-C's interior</b> has open radioactive barrels that <b>quickly deal 1 damage per hit</b> to any player within its radius. The player can sacrifice some hp to close these barrels by walking up to and interacting with them.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Altar_.28Mysterious_Object.27s_Slot.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Altar_(Mysterious_Object's_Slot)\">Altar (Mysterious Object's Slot)</span></h3>\n<p><b>Fission-C's exterior</b> also has an altar where a mysterious object can be placed. To reach it, look north of the back of the ship and follow the left pathway past the two barrels. This <b>mysterious object</b> is <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>a <b>Brooding seed</b> that can found in a hidden chamber on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Berunah\" title=\"Berunah\"><b>Berunah</b></a>. Placing the seed will cause a warning message to appear that says \"A Cosmic Entity of unknown power has turned it's focus towards this planet\".</span></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>This dramatically alters the terrain on the exterior, causes several tentacles to appear on the exterior that deal 20 damage per hit on contact, visually alters the interior, and causes the <a href=\"/wiki/Assimilated_Growth\" title=\"Assimilated Growth\"><b>Assimilated Growth</b></a> to almost immediately spawn in the interior when landing on the moon in the future. This persists until players are fired unless seeds are also placed on the exteriors of <a href=\"/wiki/Etern\" title=\"Etern\"><b>Etern</b></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios\" title=\"Filitrios\"><b>Filitrios</b></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gloom\" title=\"Gloom\"><b>Gloom</b></a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Utril\" title=\"Utril\"><b>Utril</b></a>, in which case the changes become permanent on that save file.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Logging <b>\"Radio Message 1\"</b> found on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Motra\" title=\"Motra\">Motra</a>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Selector\" title=\"Selector\"><big> <b>Selector:</b> </big></a> Craft a \"Blank floppy disc\" on <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\">Galetry</a>, insert it into the Floppy Disc Machine found on the exterior, and log the \"Selector floppy disc\".</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Battery</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Battery.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Battery.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Battery.png/60px-Battery.png?320d1d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Battery.png/90px-Battery.png?320d1d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Battery.png/120px-Battery.png?320d1d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>28</td>\n<td>46</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>134</td>\n<td>12.82%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bottle</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bo