td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0.73%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Girl</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0.36%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Enemy_Spawns_.28Exterior.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Enemy Name</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Max Spawned</th>\n<th>Power Lvl.</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hygrodere</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>53.57%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eyeless Dog</td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>39.29%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nutcracker</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3.57%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Thumper</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3.57%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Enemy_Spawns_.28Daytime.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime)\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime)</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n</table><table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Enemy Name</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Max Spawned</th>\n<th>Power Lvl.</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Circut Bees</td>\n<td>39</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>57.35%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Manticoil</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>20.59%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hygrodere</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>16.18%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Roaming Locust</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>5.88%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Lore\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Lore\">&gt; Lore</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Plan_1\">The Plan 1</span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image &amp; Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_plan_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"The plan 1.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/The_plan_1.png/205px-The_plan_1.png?9b66b3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"205\" height=\"300\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_plan_1.png/307px-The_plan_1.png?9b66b3 1.5x, /images/thumb/The_plan_1.png/409px-The_plan_1.png?9b66b3 2x\" data-file-width=\"768\" data-file-height=\"1125\" /></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">I need to burn these notes later, can't risk anyone finding out about this.<br />My 'friend' Aaron has been a nuisance my entire life.<br />He stole my girlfriend, he stole my job!<br />I can't keep acting friendly while he's around.<br />I HATE HIM!\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Plan_2\">The Plan 2</span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image &amp; Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_plan_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"The plan 2.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/The_plan_2.png/205px-The_plan_2.png?a4cc09\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"205\" height=\"300\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_plan_2.png/307px-The_plan_2.png?a4cc09 1.5x, /images/thumb/The_plan_2.png/409px-The_plan_2.png?a4cc09 2x\" data-file-width=\"768\" data-file-height=\"1125\" /></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>The plan:</b><br /><br />I am going to kill Aaron.<br />I must.<br />I don't want there to be any evidence after so.<br />I'll have to burn everyhing. Anyways.<br />Once he has arrived aI will lead him over to a small room where we used to hang out as children.<br />And when he thinks he's safe I'll hrab my baseball bat and if not kill him, knock him unconsious.<br />I'll hide his body in one of those giant standing Jack-in-the-box boxes that used to scare me to death.<br />I'll have to improvise after.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Plan_3\">The Plan 3</span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image &amp; Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_plan_3.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"The plan 3.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/The_plan_3.png/205px-The_plan_3.png?cae392\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"205\" height=\"300\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_plan_3.png/307px-The_plan_3.png?cae392 1.5x, /images/thumb/The_plan_3.png/409px-The_plan_3.png?cae392 2x\" data-file-width=\"768\" data-file-height=\"1125\" /></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">I.. I can't believe I actually did it.<br />His body flopped right onto the floor.<br />I picked him up, now all covered in blood and I dumped him into one of those boxes.<br />I wasn't quite sure what to do next so I closed it and pushed it into a giant pool of toxic waste.<br />In hindsight he might've still been alive.<br />Not that it matters now..<br />My geiger counter reads dangerous levels now.<br />I need to burn my stuff and leave before the radiation kills me..<br />Bye Bye Aaron.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Plan_4\">The Plan 4</span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image &amp; Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_plan_4.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"The plan 4.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/The_plan_4.png/205px-The_plan_4.png?d98084\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"205\" height=\"300\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_plan_4.png/307px-The_plan_4.png?d98084 1.5x, /images/thumb/The_plan_4.png/409px-The_plan_4.png?d98084 2x\" data-file-width=\"768\" data-file-height=\"1125\" /></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">He didn't die.. He DIDN'T DIE!!<br />At least I don't think he did.. I saw that box.<br />It was walking..<br />It was stalking me with his corpse still inside it.<br />It can't be possible.<br />There wasn't even machinery inside it.<br />Not much at least.<br /><br />After a few minutes it stopped and started cranking itself..<br />I ran away.<br /><br />I am hiding, not sure what to do now.<br /><br />SOMETHING IS COMING!<br />I HEAR SCREAMS!<br />I AM SO SOR-\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n\n</div>", "images": ["FissionPreviewImage.png", "Fission-C_(Icon).png", "Fission-C_in_space.jpg", "Fission-C_topvieww.jpg", "Information.png", "Fission_inside_loop.wav", "Battery.png", "Bottle.png", "Bottles.png", "Geigercounter.png", "Generator.png", "Gold_bar.png", "Green_test_tube.png", "GunkfishPlushiePH.png", "Hazmat_mask.png", "HomemadeSporeEmitterPH.png", "LegallyDistinctBatleyPH.png", "Maneater_plushie.png", "Plastic_box.png", "(Ingredient)_Plastic_stock.png", "Radioactive_barrel.png", "Radioactive_rod.png", "(Ingredient)_Rubber_roll.png", "Rum_bottle.png", "Security_camera.png", "Silent_package.png", "(Lore)_The_plan_1.png", "(Lore)_The_plan_2.png", "(Lore)_The_plan_3.png", "(Lore)_The_plan_4.png", "Toy_nutcracker.png", "V-type_engine.png", "Webley.png", "Yield_sign.png", "The_plan_1.png", "The_plan_2.png", "The_plan_3.png", "The_plan_4.png"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes", "Pages_with_spoilers", "Moons"]}